  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "TUT_ADDON_ARCANE_ENGINEERING",
      "pages": [
        {
          "id": "arcane_engineering:tut_addon_arcane_engineering/text/1",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.arcane_engineering.tut_addon_arcane_engineering.text.1",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "奥法工程学是什么\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "arcane_engineering:tut_addon_arcane_engineering/text/2",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.arcane_engineering.tut_addon_arcane_engineering.text.2",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "它连接神秘时代与"
                },
                {
                  "text": "沉浸工程",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "（Immersive Engineering）：可升级的防腐木法杖、钢和琥珀金杖端、三种法杖升级，以及给沉浸工程钻机使用的神秘钻头和虚空钻头（3×3 采掘），另有推进靴和节点干扰器。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "arcane_engineering:tut_addon_arcane_engineering/divider/3",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "arcane_engineering:tut_addon_arcane_engineering/text/4",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.arcane_engineering.tut_addon_arcane_engineering.text.4",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "从哪里开始\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "arcane_engineering:tut_addon_arcane_engineering/text/5",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.arcane_engineering.tut_addon_arcane_engineering.text.5",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "arcane_engineering:MAGITECH"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：魔法技术，自动解锁。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "arcane_engineering:ROD_upgradeable"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：防腐木杖柄，可以安装升级的法杖。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "arcane_engineering:CAP_steel"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：钢杖端。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "arcane_engineering:DRILLTHAUMIUM"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：神秘钻头。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "arcane_engineering:IMPULSEBOOTS"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：推进靴，自动解锁。\n分页中放有基础法杖工艺、神秘锭等原版研究的镜像，点击会跳回原研究。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
